WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Crouching light punch whiffs while Ryu recovers.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.275
Standing heavy kick hits Ryu on wake-up.

3
00:00:01.275 --> 00:00:01.750
Crouching medium punch links after heavy kick.

4
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.400
Standing light kick continues the grounded confirm.

5
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.525
OD Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

6
00:00:03.525 --> 00:00:04.150
Light Sand Blast continues the corner juggle.

7
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:06.300
Light Rising Uppercut finishes the juggle.
